{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium Shopify landing page section placed directly below the hero banner.
    
    This section should present TOP discounted products in a clean, minimal, premium style matching the beige Ahinsa campaign design.
    
    Section purpose
    
    Show a curated selection of promotional products divided into two tabs:
    
    Dámy
    Pánové
    
    When the user clicks a tab, the visible products switch instantly without page reload.
    
    Product logic
    This is not an automatically generated collection grid.
    The merchant must be able to manually choose the products directly in the Shopify theme editor.
    There should be:
    4 manually selected products for Dámy
    4 manually selected products for Pánové
    Only one tab’s 4 products are visible at a time.
    Layout
    Section heading above products:
    small overline: “AHINSA DAYS VÝBĚR”
    main heading: “Vybrané modely v akci”
    Under the heading, show tab navigation:
    Dámy
    Pánové
    Active tab must be visually highlighted with underline or stronger text color.
    Below tabs, display a grid of 4 product cards on desktop.
    On tablet/mobile, make the layout responsive:
    2 columns on tablet
    1 or 2 columns on mobile depending on available width
    Maintain premium spacing and clean alignment.
    Product card content
    
    Each product card should show:
    
    optional product label badge in top-left corner, such as:
    “NOVINKA”
    “AKCE”
    product image
    product category / short type label
    product title
    price
    compare-at price when available
    discounted price highlighted in accent color if product is on sale
    
    Use the selected Shopify product data automatically for:
    
    image
    title
    price
    compare-at price
    product URL
    
    Also allow an optional manual badge text per card inside the theme editor.
    
    Interaction
    Clicking on a product card should open the product page.
    Switching tabs should feel smooth, ideally with a subtle fade or content transition.
    CTA below the products
    
    Add a centered button below the product grid:
    
    Text: “Zobrazit celou nabídku”
    
    When clicked, the page should smooth scroll further down the same landing page to a lower section containing the full standard product listing.
    
    Scroll behavior
    Add a setting in the Shopify theme editor for the target anchor ID or section ID.
    The CTA button should smooth scroll to that target section.
    Do not link to another page unless no anchor is provided.
    Theme editor settings
    
    Make everything editable in Shopify theme editor, including:
    
    overline text
    main heading
    tab labels
    4 selected products for Dámy
    4 selected products for Pánové
    optional custom badge text for each selected product
    CTA button text
    CTA scroll target anchor ID
    colors
    spacing
    desktop and mobile typography
    Mobile requirements
    Tabs must work well on mobile and remain easy to tap.
    Heading must keep strong hierarchy on mobile.
    Product cards must remain readable and well spaced.
    Add separate mobile typography controls in the Shopify schema for:
    heading size
    tab label size
    product title size
    price size
    button text size
    Technical requirements
    Build as a Shopify section using Liquid, HTML, CSS, and minimal JavaScript.
    Use semantic and maintainable markup.
    The section must be fully responsive.
    Products must be selected manually through blocks or product picker settings in the theme editor.
    Keep the code clean and reusable.
    Design direction
    premium
    minimal
    elegant
    neutral beige palette
    refined typography
    subtle borders
    soft whitespace
    visually consistent with the Ahinsa Days hero banner
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-promo-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  }

  .ai-promo-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-promo-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-promo-overline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.overline_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.overline_weight }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.overline_spacing }}px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.overline_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.overline_margin }}px;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.hd_ffamily.family }}, {{ block.settings.hd_ffamily.fallback_families }};
  }

  .ai-promo-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_weight }};
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.hd_ffamily.family }}, {{ block.settings.hd_ffamily.fallback_families }};
  }

  .ai-promo-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.tab_gap }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.tabs_spacing }}px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.tab_border_color }};
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ai-promo-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: {{ block.settings.tab_padding }}px {{ block.settings.tab_padding | times: 2 }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.tab_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.tab_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.tab_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
    position: relative;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.hd_ffamily.family }}, {{ block.settings.hd_ffamily.fallback_families }};
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-promo-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    color: {{ block.settings.tab_active_color }};
  }

  .ai-promo-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    color: {{ block.settings.tab_active_color }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.tab_active_weight }};
  }

  .ai-promo-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: {{ block.settings.tab_underline_height }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.tab_active_color }};
  }

  .ai-promo-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 400px;
  }

  .ai-promo-tab-panel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
  }

  .ai-promo-tab-panel-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    display: block;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-promo-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.grid_gap }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.cta_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-promo-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-promo-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .ai-promo-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.image_ratio }}%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.image_bg_color }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-promo-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.5s ease;
  }

  .ai-promo-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-promo-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .ai-promo-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: {{ block.settings.badge_position }}px;
    left: {{ block.settings.badge_position }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.badge_padding }}px {{ block.settings.badge_padding | times: 1.5 }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.badge_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.badge_weight }};
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-promo-card-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.card_text_align }};
  }

  .ai-promo-card-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.category_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.category_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.category_margin }}px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .ai-promo-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.title_margin }}px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-promo-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: {{ block.settings.card_text_align }};
  }

  .ai-promo-price-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.compare_price_color }};
    text-decoration: line-through;
  }

  .ai-promo-price-current-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.price_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.price_color }};
  }

  .ai-promo-price-sale-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.sale_price_color }};
  }

  .ai-promo-cta-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-promo-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_v }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_h }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_weight }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border: {{ block.settings.button_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.hd_ffamily.family }}, {{ block.settings.hd_ffamily.fallback_families }};
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-promo-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_border }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-promo-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .ai-promo-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.tab_size_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-price-current-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-promo-price-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.price_size_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.button_size_tablet }}px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-promo-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top_mobile }}px 0 {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.columns_mobile }}, 1fr);
      gap: {{ block.settings.grid_gap_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-overline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.overline_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.tab_size_mobile }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.tab_padding_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.tab_padding_mobile | times: 1.5 }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-card-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.category_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-price-current-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-promo-price-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.price_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.button_size_mobile }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_v_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_h_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.badge_size_mobile }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.badge_padding_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.badge_padding_mobile | times: 1.5 }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<promo-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-promo-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-promo-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-promo-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.overline != blank %}
        <div class="ai-promo-overline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.overline }}</div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-promo-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-promo-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <button class="ai-promo-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }} active" data-tab="damy">
        {{ block.settings.tab_label_women }}
      </button>
      <button class="ai-promo-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-tab="panove">
        {{ block.settings.tab_label_men }}
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-promo-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-promo-tab-panel-{{ ai_gen_id }} active" data-panel="damy">
        <div class="ai-promo-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% for i in (1..4) %}
            {% assign product_key = 'product_women_' | append: i %}
            {% assign badge_key = 'badge_women_' | append: i %}
            {% assign product = block.settings[product_key] %}
            {% assign badge_text = block.settings[badge_key] %}

            {% if product != blank %}
              <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ai-promo-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-promo-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if badge_text != blank %}
                    <div class="ai-promo-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ badge_text }}</div>
                  {% endif %}
                  {% if product.featured_image %}
                    <img
                      src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                      alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                      class="ai-promo-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                      loading="lazy"
                      width="800"
                      height="{{ 800 | times: block.settings.image_ratio | divided_by: 100 }}"
                    >
                  {% else %}
                    <div class="ai-promo-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                    </div>
                  {% endif %}
                    </div>
                <div class="ai-promo-card-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if product.type != blank %}
                  
                  {% endif %}
                  <h3 class="ai-promo-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.title }}</h3>
                  <div class="ai-promo-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                      <span class="ai-promo-price-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
                      <span class="ai-promo-price-current-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-promo-price-sale-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
                    {% else %}
                      <span class="ai-promo-price-current-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
                    {% endif %}
                  </div>
                </div>
              </a>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-promo-tab-panel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-panel="panove">
        <div class="ai-promo-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% for i in (1..4) %}
            {% assign product_key = 'product_men_' | append: i %}
            {% assign badge_key = 'badge_men_' | append: i %}
            {% assign product = block.settings[product_key] %}
            {% assign badge_text = block.settings[badge_key] %}

            {% if product != blank %}
              <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ai-promo-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-promo-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if badge_text != blank %}
                    <div class="ai-promo-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ badge_text }}</div>
                  {% endif %}
                  {% if product.featured_image %}
                    <img
                      src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                      alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                      class="ai-promo-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                      loading="lazy"
                      width="800"
                      height="{{ 800 | times: block.settings.image_ratio | divided_by: 100 }}"
                    >
                  {% else %}
                    <div class="ai-promo-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                    </div>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>
                <div class="ai-promo-card-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if product.type != blank %}
                  
                  {% endif %}
                  <h3 class="ai-promo-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.title }}</h3>
                  <div class="ai-promo-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                      <span class="ai-promo-price-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
                      <span class="ai-promo-price-current-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-promo-price-sale-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
                    {% else %}
                      <span class="ai-promo-price-current-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
                    {% endif %}
                  </div>
                </div>
              </a>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.cta_text != blank %}
      <div class="ai-promo-cta-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <button class="ai-promo-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-scroll-target="{{ block.settings.scroll_target }}">
          {{ block.settings.cta_text }}
        </button>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</promo-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class PromoSection{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.tabs = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-promo-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.panels = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-promo-tab-panel-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.ctaButton = this.querySelector('.ai-promo-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}');

        this.tabs.forEach(tab => {
          tab.addEventListener('click', () => this.switchTab(tab));
        });

        if (this.ctaButton) {
          this.ctaButton.addEventListener('click', () => this.handleScroll());
        }
      }

      switchTab(selectedTab) {
        const targetPanel = selectedTab.getAttribute('data-tab');

        this.tabs.forEach(tab => {
          tab.classList.remove('active');
        });

        this.panels.forEach(panel => {
          panel.classList.remove('active');
        });

        selectedTab.classList.add('active');

        const activePanel = this.querySelector(`[data-panel="${targetPanel}"]`);
        if (activePanel) {
          activePanel.classList.add('active');
        }
      }

      handleScroll() {
        const targetId = this.ctaButton.getAttribute('data-scroll-target');
        if (targetId) {
          const targetElement = document.getElementById(targetId);
          if (targetElement) {
            targetElement.scrollIntoView({
              behavior: 'smooth',
              block: 'start'
            });
          }
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('promo-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}', PromoSection{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

